# The Perfetto release `install.sh --with-perfetto` installs `tracebox` from, and the SHA-256 of each archive: the installer
# refuses anything else. The numbers are the digests GitHub shows for the release assets, checked against a download
# on 2026-10-22. To move to a new release, change all three lines of both architectures, reinstall on a lab host, and run the
# agent's tests; never edit one without the other.
